From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:11:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(preloader): Signal Lock, a 1.4s studio-playhead boot

A playhead sweeps three track lanes; the name decodes out of vertical reels of
procedural monoline glyphs while two pathLength rulers draw and a timecode
scrambles to LOCKED; the poster thumps and the lanes shutter open onto the live
page. Overlay only (fixed, inset-0, contain: strict, pointer-events-none),
zero assets, one TIMELINE feeding the CSS as custom properties, and a separate
reduced-motion composition. Swapped into LandingGate in place of the slat-count
boot.
